# Test

## When to use this skill

- Running E2E tests
- Debugging test failures
- Writing new tests

## How to run tests

### Whole suite (deploys first)

```bash
task test
```

### Targeted test by tag

```bash
task test -- --grep "@my-tag"
```

### Fast TDD cycle (no rebuild)

```bash
task project:test:tdd
```

### Project tests only (no guards)

```bash
task project:test
```

